{"id":58,"date":"2008-12-19T18:34:57","date_gmt":"2008-12-19T16:34:57","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/videos.biketravellers.com\/?p=58"},"modified":"2008-12-19T18:38:20","modified_gmt":"2008-12-19T16:38:20","slug":"the-biciclown-millions-of-smiles-around-the-world","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"http:\/\/videos.biketravellers.com\/the-biciclown-millions-of-smiles-around-the-world\/","title":{"rendered":"The BiciClown: Millions of smiles around the world"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Here is a short video about the biciclown. He has cycled half the world, with only one goal: to make people smile. Very inspirational.<\/p>\n<span class=\"vvqbox vvqyoutube\" style=\"width:425px;height:344px;\"><span id=\"vvq-58-youtube-1\"><a href=\"http:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=jrrpW_a_gbk\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"http:\/\/img.youtube.com\/vi\/jrrpW_a_gbk\/0.jpg\" alt=\"YouTube Preview Image\" \/><\/a><\/span><\/span>\n<p>From <a title=\"The biciclown\" href=\"http:\/\/www.biciclown.com\/ing\/index.html\" target=\"_blank\">his website<\/a>:<\/p>\n<p class=\"verde gra1\"><strong>The Biciclown<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>\u00c1lvaro Neil, the biciclown, was born in Oviedo (Asturias) elon the 17th July 1967&#8230;<\/strong><\/p>\n<div class=\"fright piefoto\"><a rel=\"lightbox[biciclown]\" href=\"http:\/\/www.biciclown.com\/ing\/02\/fotos\/zoom\/foto27_1.jpg\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"http:\/\/www.biciclown.com\/ing\/02\/fotos\/normal\/foto27_1.jpg\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a><\/div>\n<p>&#8230;laughing; he cried only when he was slapped. He studied Law and Clown. At first it may seem they are not compatible activities.<\/p>\n<p>He sold his car and left his job at a Notary Office in Madrid to cycle the world and offer clown shows for free to the most humble.<\/p>\n<p>Thus, some people think he is crazy, others think he is an adventurer, and others say nothing and just jail him as he tells in his book ?Miles of Smiles?.<\/p>\n<p>He tickles the world with his bike ?spending? his life, the life others cannot spend.<\/p>\n<p>He does not think of the future, never forgets the past and lives the present, the only verbal useful tense.<\/p>\n<p class=\"azul gra1\"><strong>Objectives<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>Thousands of people have no reason whatsoever to smile, to laugh. Thanks God there are expert doctors to make them laugh!!!: the clowns<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>Cycling alone around the World during 10 years is not just a dream<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>Tickling the Earth with a simple bicycle giving a smile to the people<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong><\/strong><\/p>\n<div class=\"fright piefoto\"><a rel=\"lightbox[biciclown]\" href=\"http:\/\/www.biciclown.com\/ing\/01\/fotos\/zoom\/foto1029_2.jpg\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"http:\/\/www.biciclown.com\/ing\/01\/fotos\/normal\/foto1029_2.jpg\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a><\/div>\n<p><strong>MOSAW<\/strong> Miles Of Smiles Around the World (2004-2014)<\/p>\n<p class=\"azul gra1\"><strong>Results achieved<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>Thousands of smiles, workshops, conferences, books, dvds and a movie.<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\t<div class=\"st-post-tags\">\n\tTags: <a href=\"http:\/\/videos.biketravellers.com\/tag\/africa\/\" title=\"Africa\" rel=\"tag\">Africa<\/a>, <a href=\"http:\/\/videos.biketravellers.com\/tag\/biciclown\/\" title=\"BiciClown\" rel=\"tag\">BiciClown<\/a>, <a href=\"http:\/\/videos.biketravellers.com\/tag\/biketravellers\/\" title=\"Biketravellers\" rel=\"tag\">Biketravellers<\/a>, <a href=\"http:\/\/videos.biketravellers.com\/tag\/inspirational\/\" title=\"Inspirational\" rel=\"tag\">Inspirational<\/a>, <a href=\"http:\/\/videos.biketravellers.com\/tag\/kids\/\" title=\"kids\" rel=\"tag\">kids<\/a>, <a href=\"http:\/\/videos.biketravellers.com\/tag\/thirdworld\/\" title=\"ThirdWorld\" rel=\"tag\">ThirdWorld<\/a>, <a href=\"http:\/\/videos.biketravellers.com\/tag\/trips\/\" title=\"Trips\" rel=\"tag\">Trips<\/a>, <a href=\"http:\/\/videos.biketravellers.com\/tag\/video\/\" title=\"vide